@startuml architecture
title Trade ETL Pipeline - Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Standalone Machine" {
  [generate_trades.py] as Gen
  [load_to_snowflake.py] as Load
  [dbt Core CLI] as Dbt
  [Streamlit Dashboard] as Dash
  [Terraform CLI] as TF
  node "Docker: Apache Airflow" as Airflow {
    [Scheduler]
    [Webserver]
  }
}

cloud "Terraform Cloud" as TFC {
  [Remote state] as TFState
}

cloud "Snowflake (Trial Account)" {
  database "TRADE_ETL_DB" {
    folder "RAW schema" {
      [RAW_TRADES_STAGE] as Stage
      [RAW_TRADES table] as RawTable
    }
    folder "STAGING schema (dbt)" {
      [stg_trades view]
    }
    folder "MARTS schema (dbt)" {
      [int_trade_classification]
      [fct_valid_trades]
      [fct_rejected_trades]
    }
  }
  [Query History / Warehouse Metering\n(admin views)] as AdminViews
  [HIGH_REJECTION_RATE Alert\n(terraform/monitoring.tf)] as Alert
}

package "GitHub" {
  [Repo: code + dbt + terraform] as Repo
  [Actions: dbt_ci / terraform_ci / python_ci] as CI
  [production Environment\n(manual approval)] as Env
}

node "Email inbox" as Inbox

Gen --> Load : writes .jsonl files
Load --> Stage : PUT (stage file)
Stage --> RawTable : COPY INTO
Airflow --> Gen : triggers
Airflow --> Load : triggers
Airflow --> Dbt : triggers dbt run / test /\nrun-operation mark_expired_trades
Dbt --> RawTable : reads
Dbt --> [stg_trades view]
[stg_trades view] --> [int_trade_classification]
[int_trade_classification] --> [fct_valid_trades] : disposition = VALID_CURRENT
[int_trade_classification] --> [fct_rejected_trades] : disposition LIKE REJECTED_%
[fct_rejected_trades] ..> Alert : 60-minute schedule
Alert --> Inbox : SYSTEM$SEND_EMAIL
Airflow ..> Inbox : email_on_failure
Dash --> [fct_valid_trades] : queries
Dash --> [fct_rejected_trades] : queries
TF --> TFState : state (CLI-driven,\nexecution mode: local)
TF --> "Snowflake (Trial Account)" : provisions DB/schema/\nwarehouse/role/stage/alert
Repo --> CI : on push/PR
CI --> "Snowflake (Trial Account)" : validate: dbt build /\nterraform plan (CI schema)
CI --> Env : deploy, gated
Env --> "Snowflake (Trial Account)" : terraform apply /\ndbt run --target dev

@enduml
